  <script slot="head" type="application/ld+json" set:html={"{\n \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n \"@graph\": [\n  {\n   \"@type\": [\n    \"AccountingService\",\n    \"ProfessionalService\"\n   ],\n   \"@id\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/#org\",\n   \"name\": \"Slim Geregeld Administratie\",\n   \"alternateName\": \"Slim Geregeld\",\n   \"url\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/\",\n   \"logo\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/Slim%20Geregeld%20Administratie%20-%20Pictogram%20logo%20transparant%20500x500.png\",\n   \"image\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/slim-geregeld-preview.jpg\",\n   \"email\": \"kyle@slim-geregeld.nl\",\n   \"telephone\": \"+31621311043\",\n   \"address\": {\n    \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n    \"addressLocality\": \"Koog aan de Zaan\",\n    \"addressCountry\": \"NL\"\n   },\n   \"areaServed\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Country\",\n    \"name\": \"Netherlands\"\n   },\n   \"knowsLanguage\": [\n    \"en\",\n    \"nl\"\n   ],\n   \"identifier\": {\n    \"@type\": \"PropertyValue\",\n    \"propertyID\": \"KVK\",\n    \"value\": \"92596991\"\n   },\n   \"vatID\": \"NL004963420B24\",\n   \"founder\": {\n    \"@id\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/#kyle\"\n   },\n   \"sameAs\": [\n    \"https://www.moneybird.nl/experts/slim-geregeld-administratie/\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"@type\": \"Person\",\n   \"@id\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/#kyle\",\n   \"name\": \"Kyle Bouwmeester\",\n   \"jobTitle\": \"Becon-registered bookkeeper\",\n   \"worksFor\": {\n    \"@id\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/#org\"\n   },\n   \"image\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/Pofielfoto%20Kyle.jpg\",\n   \"knowsLanguage\": [\n    \"en\",\n    \"nl\"\n   ],\n   \"hasCredential\": {\n    \"@type\": \"EducationalOccupationalCredential\",\n    \"name\": \"Becon registration 781794\",\n    \"credentialCategory\": \"Registration as tax intermediary\",\n    \"recognizedBy\": {\n     \"@type\": \"GovernmentOrganization\",\n     \"name\": \"Belastingdienst (Dutch Tax Administration)\"\n    }\n   }\n  },\n  {\n   \"@type\": \"WebSite\",\n   \"@id\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/#website\",\n   \"url\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/\",\n   \"name\": \"Slim Geregeld\",\n   \"publisher\": {\n    \"@id\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/#org\"\n   }\n  },\n  {\n   \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\n   \"@id\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/daft/renewal/#webpage\",\n   \"url\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/daft/renewal/\",\n   \"name\": \"DAFT and DJTT permit renewal statement\",\n   \"description\": \"Signed balance sheet and profit and loss account for the previous financial year and the current year to date, for renewing a DAFT or Dutch-Japanese Trade Treaty residence permit, by a Becon-registered Dutch bookkeeper.\",\n   \"inLanguage\": \"en\",\n   \"isPartOf\": {\n    \"@id\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/#website\"\n   },\n   \"publisher\": {\n    \"@id\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/#org\"\n   },\n   \"breadcrumb\": {\n    \"@id\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/daft/renewal/#breadcrumb\"\n   },\n   \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-21\",\n   \"primaryImageOfPage\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/slim-geregeld-preview.jpg\",\n   \"author\": {\n    \"@id\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/#kyle\"\n   },\n   \"mainEntity\": {\n    \"@id\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/daft/renewal/#service\"\n   }\n  },\n  {\n   \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n   \"@id\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/daft/renewal/#breadcrumb\",\n   \"itemListElement\": [\n    {\n     \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n     \"position\": 1,\n     \"name\": \"Slim Geregeld\",\n     \"item\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n     \"position\": 2,\n     \"name\": \"DAFT\",\n     \"item\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/daft/\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n     \"position\": 3,\n     \"name\": \"Renewal\",\n     \"item\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/daft/renewal/\"\n    }\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"@type\": \"Service\",\n   \"@id\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/daft/renewal/#service\",\n   \"name\": \"DAFT and DJTT permit renewal statement\",\n   \"serviceType\": \"Signed financial statements for the renewal of a DAFT or DJTT residence permit\",\n   \"description\": \"Signed balance sheet and profit and loss account for the previous financial year and the current year to date, for renewing a DAFT or Dutch-Japanese Trade Treaty residence permit, by a Becon-registered Dutch bookkeeper.\",\n   \"provider\": {\n    \"@id\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/#org\"\n   },\n   \"areaServed\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Country\",\n    \"name\": \"Netherlands\"\n   },\n   \"availableChannel\": {\"@type\": \"ServiceChannel\", \"serviceUrl\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/daft/renewal/\", \"availableLanguage\": \"en\"},\n   \"audience\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Audience\",\n    \"audienceType\": \"US and Japanese entrepreneurs renewing a Dutch self-employed residence permit under the Dutch-American Friendship Treaty or the Dutch-Japanese Trade Treaty\"\n   },\n   \"offers\": [\n    {\n     \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n     \"name\": \"Renewal\",\n     \"price\": \"495\",\n     \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\",\n     \"description\": \"Signed renewal statement within 5 working days, excl. VAT, when the figures for both years exist\",\n     \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n     \"priceSpecification\": {\n      \"@type\": \"PriceSpecification\",\n      \"price\": \"495\",\n      \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\",\n      \"valueAddedTaxIncluded\": false\n     }\n    },\n    {\n     \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n     \"name\": \"Renewal Priority\",\n     \"price\": \"595\",\n     \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\",\n     \"description\": \"Signed renewal statement within 48 hours, excl. VAT\",\n     \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n     \"priceSpecification\": {\n      \"@type\": \"PriceSpecification\",\n      \"price\": \"595\",\n      \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\",\n      \"valueAddedTaxIncluded\": false\n     }\n    },\n    {\n     \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n     \"name\": \"Compliance Plan\",\n     \"price\": \"79\",\n     \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\",\n     \"description\": \"Monthly bookkeeping for an eenmanszaak or VOF, €79 or €149 a month excluding VAT, minimum 12 months, balance sheet and renewal statement included\",\n     \"priceSpecification\": {\n      \"@type\": \"UnitPriceSpecification\",\n      \"price\": \"79\",\n      \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\",\n      \"unitCode\": \"MON\",\n      \"valueAddedTaxIncluded\": false\n     }\n    }\n   ],\n   \"url\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/daft/renewal/\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n   \"@id\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/daft/renewal/#faq\",\n   \"inLanguage\": \"en\",\n   \"isPartOf\": {\n    \"@id\": \"https://slim-geregeld.nl/daft/renewal/#webpage\"\n   },\n   \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n     \"@type\": \"Question\",\n     \"name\": \"Is a bank statement enough for the renewal?\",\n     \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"No. The IND asks for a balance sheet and a profit and loss account for the current and the previous financial year, checked by an authorised independent expert, and states that a bank statement alone is not sufficient. The figures have to show that the capital you invested is still in the business.\"\n     }\n    },\n    {\n     \"@type\": \"Question\",\n     \"name\": \"When should I start?\",\n     \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"About three months before your permit ends. That leaves time to close the previous year, draw up the current year so far and have the statement signed before your appointment. Your first permit runs for two years; the renewal then gives you five.\"\n     }\n    },\n    {\n     \"@type\": \"Question\",\n     \"name\": \"My bookkeeping is in a spreadsheet. Is that a problem?\",\n     \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"A spreadsheet is a perfectly good starting point, and often a tidy one. It is a source, though, and the two years still have to be written up as proper figures before anything can be signed. That work is quoted separately, after I have seen your files and always before I start.\"\n     }\n    },\n    {\n     \"@type\": \"Question\",\n     \"name\": \"What if my equity is now below EUR 4,500?\",\n     \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Tell me early. Often it is a bookkeeping matter: equipment booked as an expense instead of an investment, income that has not been booked, or private withdrawals booked the wrong way. That gets checked first. Figures that are correct stay correct, and if the equity really is short, you hear it plainly and in time to act.\"\n     }\n    },\n    {\n     \"@type\": \"Question\",\n     \"name\": \"Does this work for the Japanese treaty as well?\",\n     \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Yes. A renewal under the Dutch-Japanese Trade Treaty (DJTT) asks for the same figures and the same signed statement, and it is handled in exactly the same way.\"\n     }\n    },\n    {\n     \"@type\": \"Question\",\n     \"name\": \"What does it cost?\",\n     \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"The signed statement is €495 excluding VAT, delivered within five working days once the figures and the payment are in, or €595 within 48 hours. That assumes the figures for both years exist. Writing them up from receipts or a spreadsheet comes on top and is quoted in advance. On the Compliance Plan the renewal statement is included.\"\n     }\n    },\n    {\n     \"@type\": \"Question\",\n     \"name\": \"Do I need to come to your office?\",\n     \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"No. Everything is remote: you send your figures and documents by email and receive the signed statement as a PDF.\"\n     }\n    }\n   ]\n  }\n ]\n}"} />
